Error [E0109]: The power operator `^` can't compare or combine String (text) and Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/sigil_power_operator_misuse.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     print("left" ^ 2)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The two sides of an operator must be the same type
 Fix: Make both sides the same type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
